              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["DE","F"] },
            { text: "I say that, alternately, {C} is the same parts or part of {F} that {AB} is of {DE}.",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["C","F","AB","DE"] },
            { text: "Since {DE} is the same parts of {F} as {AB} is of {C},",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["DE","F","AB","C"] },
            { text: "therefore {F} is the same parts of {DE} as {C} is of {AB}.",
              visible: GIVEN,
